# Minimise Docker/Railway build-context exposure.
# Secrets must never be supplied as Docker ARGs; use provider/runtime secret mechanisms.
.git
.git/**
.github
.github/**

.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.npmrc
**/.npmrc
.netrc
**/.netrc
.pypirc
**/.pypirc

**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.*
**/id_ed25519
**/id_ed25519.*
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*service_account*.json

node_modules
**/node_modules
coverage
**/coverage
.nyc_output
**/.nyc_output
*.log
**/*.log
